<% content_for :title, "Pixel Support · Lilly Bit Games" %>
<article class="policy-page">
  <h1>Need a hand?</h1>
  <p>Pixel draws. You guess. Play solo or invite friends into the same room on iPhone, iPad, Android, or the web.</p>
  <h2>Play</h2>
  <p>Choose Solo or Friends, pick a category and artist, and tap Play. In a friends room, share the invite, then start when everyone is ready. Type as many guesses as you like before time runs out. Faster correct guesses earn more points.</p>
  <h2>Connection</h2>
  <p>Pixel needs an internet connection. If a drawing takes a moment, keep the app open. For a failed drawing, the host can tap Retry. Reopen the app and tap Resume to return to your last room.</p>
  <h2>Beta feedback</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@lillybitgames.com?subject=Pixel%20feedback">hello@lillybitgames.com</a> with what happened, your device model, and a screenshot if helpful. Avoid including private information. On iOS you can also send feedback through TestFlight.</p>
  <p><%= link_to "Privacy and data requests", privacy_path %> · <%= link_to "Play on the web", root_path %></p>
</article>
